          "【2-Pack Value & Indoor Outdoor Use】 Monitor two plants at once with these moisture meters for plants. The 7.6-inch long probe reaches deep roots, ideal for indoor & outdoor plants. A watering guide is printed right on the packaging box for quick reference.",
          "【Root - Friendly Single Probe & Battery - Free】 Unlike bulkier double-probe designs, this single probe easily penetrates soil with minimal root disturbance and won't pull out much soil. No batteries required, always ready to use. Just remove and wipe clean after each test to extend its lifespan."
